贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p079","text":"定公五年，季平子卒。陽虎私怒，囚季桓子，與盟，乃捨之。七年，齊伐我，取鄆，以爲魯陽虎邑以從政。八年，陽虎欲盡殺三桓適，而更立其所善庶子以代之；載季桓子將殺之，桓子詐而得脫。三桓共攻陽虎，陽虎居陽關。九年，魯伐陽虎，陽虎奔齊，已而奔晉趙氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001182","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"季平子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001180","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001296","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"魯陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001180","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001180","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"三桓","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"庶子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001296","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001296","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m079-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"三桓","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":